WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.860 line:73%
May solar ka, pero may
Meralco bill ka pa rin?

c02
00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:05.700 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:08.800 line:73%
Sa typical
self-consumption setup,

c04
00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:13.510 line:73%
tumutulong ang solar sa
daytime electricity use mo.

c05
00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:15.996 line:73%
Pero kapag kulang
ang solar generation,

c06
00:00:16.076 --> 00:00:18.306 line:73%
o gabi na at wala
kang battery,

c07
00:00:18.386 --> 00:00:21.176 line:73%
puwede ka pa ring kumuha
ng kuryente sa grid.

c08
00:00:21.476 --> 00:00:24.626 line:73%
May mga bill charges din
na hindi basta nawawala.

c09
00:00:24.876 --> 00:00:28.986 line:73%
Kaya hindi dapat mangako
ng automatic zero bill.

c10
00:00:29.386 --> 00:00:34.796 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

c11
00:00:35.146 --> 00:00:37.626 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
